Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.83,0:22:27.53,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}負{\c}けない　私Lv.MAX
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.08,0:22:32.84,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}守{\c}りたい人場所があるから
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.01,0:22:35.64,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}強{\c}くなれる　超えて行ける
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.80,0:22:37.99,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}マ{\c}ジガチなんです
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.20,0:22:41.11,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}予{\c}測のできないこの運命
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.27,0:22:43.74,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}良{\c}いとは言い切れないけど
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.01,0:22:46.54,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}君{\c}と会えたこの人生
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.76,0:22:49.34,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}だ{\c}けで勝ち組確定
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.63,0:22:52.07,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}日{\c}が暮れても明けてても
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.43,0:22:54.82,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}ど{\c}んな時も全力で
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.00,0:22:57.50,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}笑{\c}って泣いてよく食べて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.74,0:23:00.26,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}困{\c}ったことは気にせずに
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.47,0:23:03.03,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}楽{\c}しんじゃってね　So☆Lucky
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.59,0:21:43.50,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}无{\c}法预料的人生舞台
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.70,0:21:46.42,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}或{\c}许称不上万事安泰
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.42,0:21:48.99,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}遵{\c}循本心过个优哉游哉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.16,0:21:51.68,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}烦{\c}恼琐事都不必放心怀
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.91,0:21:54.36,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}迈{\c}步向前活出自己风采
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.95,0:22:08.70,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}不{\c}曾料想会被投身于此
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.70,0:22:13.49,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}却{\c}意外收获随心放纵日子 真Lucky
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.49,0:22:16.34,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}但{\c}也别太松懈太大意
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.56,0:22:19.18,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}麻{\c}烦一个接一个接踵而至
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.34,0:22:21.81,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}求{\c}求放过我吧Happening
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.10,0:22:24.65,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}不{\c}过也罢 即使这般境地
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.83,0:22:27.53,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}也{\c}绝不能认输 我可是Lv.MAX
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.08,0:22:32.84,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}正{\c}因有要守护的人与天地
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.01,0:22:35.64,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}才{\c}能变得更强 跨过困难障壁
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.80,0:22:37.99,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}动{\c}起真格来我豪不掩饰
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.20,0:22:41.11,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}无{\c}法预料的命运安排
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.27,0:22:43.74,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}或{\c}许称不上万事安泰
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.01,0:22:46.54,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}与{\c}你相遇的今生此趟
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.76,0:22:49.34,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}便{\c}已让我稳坐胜组人生
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.63,0:22:52.07,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}无{\c}论夜幕降临晨霭初开
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.43,0:22:54.82,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}任{\c}何时候都全力对待
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.00,0:22:57.50,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}有{\c}哭有笑放开吃个自在
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.74,0:23:00.26,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}烦{\c}恼琐事都不必放心怀
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.47,0:23:03.03,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}尽{\c}情享受吧 So☆Lucky
